<newsitem itemid="195999" id="root" date="1996-11-18" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Santam lifts yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Santam lifts yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended Sept 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 242.0    vs 211.0</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)	  50.0  making 82.0 vs 70.0</p>
<p>    Net income		  176.0    vs   153.0</p>
<p>    Net premium income    1,936.0    vs 1,607.0</p>
<p>    Gross premium income  2,095.0    vs 1,759.0</p>
<p>    Underwriting profit	85.0    vs    72.0</p>
<p>    Investment income	 146.0    vs   121.0</p>
<p>    Taxation		     55.0    vs    40.0</p>
<p>Div payable Jan 31</p>
<p>On register Dec 20</p>
<p>Full name: Santam Ltd (financial-insurance)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it continued to be affected by weather patterns and high crime rates but still expected a further improvement in earnings and dividend in the current year.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town ewsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
